LAMMPS (10 Dec 2025 - Development - patch_10Dec2025-120-ga51f9ba0e7)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# Finite-T Langevin spin-dynamics stage for mp-754090 (Li4Fe2TeWO12), placeholder-DMI
# effective model -- see in.mp754090_effective.lammps for Hamiltonian, J derivation from
# real DFT, and the explicit "DMI is a placeholder, not DFT" caveat. Do not read physical
# conclusions (Tc, textures, chirality) off this run; it exists to get a first qualitative
# look while the real noncollinear+SOC DFT job for D is pending.
#
# Run via run_scan_parallel_mp754090.sh, one temperature/seed per invocation:
#   -var runtemp <K> -var runseed <int>
#
# Same LAMMPS-build workaround as in.pdfeir_dynamics.lammps: hybrid/overlay segfaults with
# exactly 2 spin substyles on this build, padded to 3 with a zero-strength spin/magelec term.

units           metal
atom_style      spin
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_modify     map array

read_restart    restart.mp754090_T0.equil
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 10 Dec 2025, LAMMPS = 10 Dec 2025
  restoring atom style spin from restart
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (86.604109 72.44143 33.758371) with tilt (47.827887 47.809739 49.151162)
WARNING: Triclinic box skew is large. LAMMPS will run inefficiently. (src/domain.cpp:221)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  restoring pair style hybrid/overlay from restart
  2048 atoms
  read_restart CPU = 0.001 seconds

variable        j_eff_eV equal 0.012058385
variable        d_shell equal 5.132075
variable        exch_a equal v_j_eff_eV*2.718281828/4.0
variable        rc_exch equal 5.25
variable        d_eV equal 0.003
variable        rc_dmi equal 5.25

pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange ${rc_exch} spin/dmi ${rc_dmi} spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 5.25 spin/dmi ${rc_dmi} spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 5.25 spin/dmi 5.25 spin/magelec ${rc_exch}
pair_style      hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 5.25 spin/dmi 5.25 spin/magelec 5.25
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange ${rc_exch} ${exch_a} 0.0 ${d_shell} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 5.25 ${exch_a} 0.0 ${d_shell} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 5.25 0.00819452220513194 0.0 ${d_shell} offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 5.25 0.00819452220513194 0.0 5.132075 offset yes
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi ${rc_dmi} ${d_eV} 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi 5.25 ${d_eV} 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/dmi dmi 5.25 0.003 0.0 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff      * * spin/magelec magelec ${rc_exch} 0.0 1.0 1.0 1.0   # zero strength: segfault workaround only
pair_coeff      * * spin/magelec magelec 5.25 0.0 1.0 1.0 1.0   

neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 check yes delay 20

fix             1 all precession/spin zeeman 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix_modify      1 energy yes
fix             2 all langevin/spin ${runtemp} 0.05 ${runseed}
fix             2 all langevin/spin 75 0.05 ${runseed}
fix             2 all langevin/spin 75 0.05 21
fix             3 all nve/spin lattice frozen

timestep        0.0001

compute         out_mag all spin
compute         outsp all property/atom spx spy spz sp
thermo_style    custom step time temp pe etotal c_out_mag[4] c_out_mag[5]
thermo          200

dump            1 all custom 500 dump_mp754090_T${runtemp}_s${runseed}.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]
dump            1 all custom 500 dump_mp754090_T75_s${runseed}.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]
dump            1 all custom 500 dump_mp754090_T75_s21.lammpstrj type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3]

# Coarse first pass -- 20k steps @ dt=0.0001 ps = 2 ps, same length as pdfeir's first pass.
run             20000

